        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-07-30T01:41:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, both my players and I take advantage of being able to pass to the environment as a story element. Accelerating the disaster that's coming on, or empowering the heroes via moving into a different zone, etc.</p>\n<p>What are people's thoughts on being able to pass to the environment turn as opposed to it always acting first or last?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:06.544Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
