        "raw": "<p>So, both my players and I take advantage of being able to pass to the environment as a story element. Accelerating the disaster that's coming on, or empowering the heroes via moving into a different zone, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What are people's thoughts on being able to pass to the environment turn as opposed to it always acting first or last?</p>",
